{%- import "src/globals.j2" as globals with context -%}
<div id="q-other-issues" class="question">
  <div class="answer">
   {%- set project_url = dc.config.client_url ~ "/projects/" ~ dc.qtn.uuid -%}
    <p>We use the <a href="{{ globals.linkUrl }}" target="_blank">{{ globals.fullName }}</a> with its <em>{{ dc.pkg.name }}</em> (ID: <span class="package-id"><span class="organization-id">{{ dc.pkg.organization_id }}</span>:<span class="km-id">{{ dc.pkg.km_id }}</span>:<span class="version">{{ dc.pkg.version }}</span></span>) knowledge model to make our DMP. More specifically, we use the <a href="{{ dc.config.client_url }}" target="_blank">{{ dc.config.client_url }}</a> {{ globals.name}} instance where the project has direct URL: <a href="{{ project_url }}" target="_blank">{{ project_url }}</a>.</p>

    {# Applied policies #}
    {%- if data.dmp.policies|length > 0 -%}
    <p>We will be using the following policies and procedures for data management:</p>
    <ul>
    {%- for policy in data.dmp.policies -%}
        <li>
            {% if policy.name %}
            <strong>{{ policy.name._value }}</strong>:{{ macros.linkQuestion(policy.name._path) }}
            {% else %}<strong>no name given</strong>
            {% endif %}
            {% if policy.url %}
            <strong><a href="{{ policy.url._value }}" target="_blank">{{ policy.url._value }}</a></strong>{{ macros.linkQuestion(policy.url._path) }}
            {% endif %}
            {% if policy.description._value %}
              <br>{{ policy.description._value }}{{ macros.linkQuestion(policy.description._path) }}
            {% else %}
              <br>(no description given)
            {% endif %}
            {% if policy.scope|length > 0 %}
              <br>Scope: {{ policy.scope | map(attribute='_label') | map('lower') | join(', ') }}{{ macros.linkQuestion(policy.scope[0]._path) }}
            {% endif %}
        </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
    {%- else -%}
    <p>We will not be using any other national, funder, sectorial, nor departmental policies or procedures for data management.</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>